{"slug":"/students/subjects/biology/regulation/","source":"students/subjects/biology/regulation/index.html","area":"students","kind":"division","title":"Regulation & Coordination | Biology","description":"","subject":"biology","body":"<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n        <nav class=\"mb-8\">\n            <a href=\"/students/subjects/biology/\" class=\"text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700\">← Back to Biology</a>\n        </nav>\n        \n        <div class=\"content-card rounded-xl p-8\">\n            <header class=\"mb-8\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Regulation &amp; Coordination</h1>\n                <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600\">Understanding how organisms maintain internal balance and respond to their environment</p>\n            </header>\n\n            <div class=\"space-y-8\">\n                <!-- Division Overview -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Division Overview</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-700\">\n                        This division explores how living organisms maintain their internal environment and coordinate responses \n                        to external changes. From basic homeostatic mechanisms to complex nervous and hormonal systems, \n                        you'll learn about the intricate control systems that keep organisms functioning optimally.\n                    </p>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Topics -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-6\">Topics</h2>\n                    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                        <a href=\"/students/subjects/biology/regulation/homeostasis/\" class=\"block p-6 bg-white/50 rounded-lg hover:bg-white/60 transition\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2\">1. Internal Environment Regulation</h3>\n                            <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-1\">\n                                <li>• Temperature regulation</li>\n                                <li>• pH balance</li>\n                                <li>• Water balance</li>\n                                <li>• Homeostatic mechanisms</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </a>\n\n                        <a href=\"/students/subjects/biology/regulation/nervous-coordination/\" class=\"block p-6 bg-white/50 rounded-lg hover:bg-white/60 transition\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2\">2. Nervous Coordination</h3>\n                            <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-1\">\n                                <li>• Neuron structure and function</li>\n                                <li>• Synaptic transmission</li>\n                                <li>• Reflex arcs</li>\n                                <li>• Nerve impulse conduction</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </a>\n\n                        <a href=\"/students/subjects/biology/regulation/sensory-systems/\" class=\"block p-6 bg-white/50 rounded-lg hover:bg-white/60 transition\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2\">3. Sensory Systems</h3>\n                            <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-1\">\n                                <li>• Eye structure and vision</li>\n                                <li>• Ear and hearing mechanism</li>\n                                <li>• Touch receptors</li>\n                                <li>• Taste and smell</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </a>\n\n                        <a href=\"/students/subjects/biology/regulation/hormonal-coordination/\" class=\"block p-6 bg-white/50 rounded-lg hover:bg-white/60 transition\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2\">4. Hormonal Coordination</h3>\n                            <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-1\">\n                                <li>• Endocrine system overview</li>\n                                <li>• Major hormones and functions</li>\n                                <li>• Nervous-hormonal integration</li>\n                                <li>• Feedback mechanisms</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Learning Path -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Learning Path</h2>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                        <ol class=\"space-y-4 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                                <span class=\"font-medium mr-2\">1.</span>\n                                <div>\n                                    <p class=\"font-medium\">Begin with Internal Environment Regulation</p>\n                                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1\">Understand basic homeostatic principles and mechanisms that maintain internal balance.</p>\n                                </div>\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                                <span class=\"font-medium mr-2\">2.</span>\n                                <div>\n                                    <p class=\"font-medium\">Study Nervous Coordination</p>\n                                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1\">Learn about the fast-acting nervous system and its components.</p>\n                                </div>\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                                <span class=\"font-medium mr-2\">3.</span>\n                                <div>\n                                    <p class=\"font-medium\">Explore Sensory Systems</p>\n                                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1\">Examine how organisms detect and respond to environmental stimuli.</p>\n                                </div>\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                                <span class=\"font-medium mr-2\">4.</span>\n                                <div>\n                                    <p class=\"font-medium\">Complete with Hormonal Coordination</p>\n                                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1\">Understand the endocrine system and its integration with nervous control.</p>\n                                </div>\n                            </li>\n                        </ol>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Resources -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Additional Resources</h2>\n                    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Practical Work</h3>\n                            <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-1\">\n                                <li>• Reflex testing experiments</li>\n                                <li>• Sensory perception tests</li>\n                                <li>• Hormone action models</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Interactive Activities</h3>\n                            <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-1\">\n                                <li>• Nervous system simulations</li>\n                                <li>• Virtual dissections</li>\n                                <li>• Homeostasis experiments</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-teal-100 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }\n        .content-card {\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        }"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}